{"id":"14fa67446efa83b1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-quasivariety.md","title":"Quasivariety","display":"df-quasivariety — Quasivariety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-quasivariety","aliases":["93-df-quasivariety"],"display":"df-quasivariety — Quasivariety","depends_on":["[[93-df-quasi-equation]]","[[93-df-quasi-equational-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-quasivariety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-quasivariety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quasivariety — Quasivariety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" href=\"?note=1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equation\">93-df-quasi-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a11ac7fb28e6200\" href=\"?note=9a11ac7fb28e6200\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equational-class\">93-df-quasi-equational-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\mathcal Q\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> are class candidates, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a11ac7fb28e6200\" href=\"?note=9a11ac7fb28e6200\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equational-class\">93-df-quasi-equational-class</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" href=\"?note=1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equation\">93-df-quasi-equation</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> 的类参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{q:\\exists E\\;\\exists e\\;\\left(\nq=\\langle E,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}q\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{q:\\exists E\\;\\exists e\\;\\left(\nq=\\langle E,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}q\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K),\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal Q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\to\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K),\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal Q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\to\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The signature is always explicit. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\)</span> is the quasi-equational theory of a class, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> is its least containing quasivariety.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-quasi-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasi-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"9a11ac7fb28e6200","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasi-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"9a11ac7fb28e6200","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ is fixed, $\\mathcal Q$ and $\\mathcal K$ are class candidates, and $\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-quasi-equational-class]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}$ and $\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-quasi-equation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QEqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{q:\\exists E\\;\\exists e\\;\\left(\nq=\\langle E,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}q\\right)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasivariety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&\n\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K),\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal Q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal Q,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\to\n\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal Q\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false}],"bytes":2176,"backlinks":[{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f066c945ea5af293","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)$ is the least quasivariety containing $\\mathbb K$, as defined in [[93-df-quasivariety]]."},{"id":"6af93bac45e6f88d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}$ is the generated-quasivariety constructor of [[93-df-quasivariety]]."},{"id":"1dace3e025338fca","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}$, and $\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}$ have the exact signatures fixed in [[93-df-quasivariety]] and [[93-df-quasi-equational-class]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-quasivariety]]"}],"outgoing":["1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","9a11ac7fb28e6200"]}